cat << \SHAR_EOF > 'ut.1m'
.TH UT 1M
.SH NAME
ut \- show uucp log files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ut
[
.I nodename
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Ut\^
does a "curses window'ed" "tail -f" on the four
different Honey Danber uucp logfiles.
.I Uutail\^
